{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"You experience a memory you’re certain isn’t your own. The feeling of your dead body being filled with sod, straw and clay. The smell of night blooming Jasmine.  \n\n\"You are not tied to who your were. We do not know another way to tell you that you are who you are and are not the person who was. All faces are clothing to the soul. All bodies are a jar holding the sum of your actions.\" Says Huginn\n\n\"Tell roy yourself. We are not messenger birds.\" Says Muninn.\n\nYou feel yourself grow small. You feel your skin tighten and become slick. You lungs once again inhale. They inhale further than you could have ever dared to imagine before. Poison becomes a dear friend. What would kill others, is blood to you. \n\nAnd then you croak. You have become an Grung.","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:52:27.844000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T16:52:56.132000Z","id":"865999405843611679","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
