{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"Massive curling spiked structures hang out of the sky. *roots* you realize. The roots of Yggdrasil.","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:05:25.315000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869415152527761489","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"And there, in a throne made of the roots themselves sits Niddhogur. The Great Dragon. Even while laughing he holds a root to his mouth and pulls at it with gleaming white teeth against obsidian skin.","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:07:13.523000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T03:07:24.912000Z","id":"869415606385016882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Who cares to interrupt me? You speck of a soul.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:08:33.308000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869415941027549234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"The nameless bows down politely in front of the dragon as to not bring out its ire. He has heard stories of its power and would not want to be on the recieving end. \"Noone but a humble servant in search for the twin ravens. I humbly ask the great Niddhogur for help in finding their whereabouts.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:08:54.543000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T03:10:03.026000Z","id":"869416030093594664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I am prevented from interfering with spells cast by the living, but neither am I bound to offer any hospitality to an intruder unbidden. You may speak here. But I do not owe you any help, flea.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:11:58.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869416800939540550","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"The nameless straightens up. \"Please great Niddhogur. My city and my friends need the Ravens protection. If I can not go to them, then at least I wish to talk to them. I ask you this favor...\" The nameless hesitates a bit, his friends and his past experiences have warned him against making brash decisions, but he sees no other option. You can't teach an old dog new tricks. \"and am willing to work for you as payment. Surely, even a dragon as powerful as you would benefit from a representative in the mortal realm. Take me to the ravens, help me gain back their protection, and I shall enact your wishes as you see fit.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:15:27.553000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869417678496993290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I wish to talk to the ravens and bring them back myself so that my friends need no longer risk themselves by using Gungnir to visit Niflhel.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:16:24.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869417916205002843","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"You could not possibly comprehend what your gift has given me.\"\n\nIt open it's mouth wide. The ravens are in cages near the back of it's throat. .","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:18:54.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869418544553685033","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
